{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Runs a saved flow command (lib, ctl, cmd) once through flowlang's Code::execute and once through the stepper (run with policy; empty = default) and compares OUTCOMES, not event order: the result envelope and every persistent global the flow can reach (persistent ops in the body, its locals, case chain and flow callees, plus the preset keys). presets sets globals before EACH run (other reachable keys are restored to their prior values first). The stepper's trace is checked with validate. A body with a static I-1/I-2/I-4 finding is never run under Code::execute (it would hang or panic); only the stepper runs it. Returns {status, ok, safe, findings, flowlang, stepper, envelope_match, globals_flowlang, globals_stepper, globals_match, valid, violations, steps, policy, end}.","import":"use flowlang::command::Command;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse ndata::data::Data;\nuse std::panic;","params":[{"name":"lib","type":"String"},{"name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"name":"cmd","type":"String"},{"name":"args","type":"JSONObject"},{"name":"presets","type":"JSONObject"},{"name":"policy","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"uzuhpw1a16a0b877fz218","readers":[],"time":1792780549093,"username":"system","writers":[]}